ng\">Sally</span>:         For sure! Our picnic was a lot of fun, too. The park that we went to was so grassy and the air was so crisp ... I wish we could do that every day!", "id": 2, "time": "23500", "image": "engenn7le16ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     How are you going to react when you see your boss on Monday?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         I can hack it. Not a problem. I'll just pretend I didn't see her at the park. You must be exhausted after all that dancing tonight. If you went again, you should take some foldable flats, for sure.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Yeah. I wish I could dance as well as the go-go dancers at Shimmer. Their outfits were so dramatic and vibrant.", "id": 3, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn7le16ob11re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}